{
  "bodyHash": "h8B+brd2xjo=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>工具提示大修 ✨</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:left\">为 Minecraft 工具提示带来全面的视觉革新，以更清晰的布局完全取代原版工具提示系统。每一个工具提示都<em>更现代、更锐利、更清晰</em>。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>核心功能</strong> 🔧</h1><p>📜 <strong>可滚动工具提示</strong> - 当工具提示过长超出屏幕范围时，您可以<em>滚动</em>浏览其内容。<br>✂️ <strong>文本换行</strong> - 通过<em>在需要时插入换行符</em>，防止工具提示过宽。<br>🦋 <strong>装备对比</strong> - 内置可开关的装备对比功能，用于比较护甲部件与当前装备的护甲。您可以在游戏中更改按键绑定。<br>🤝 <strong>兼容性</strong> - 与 <em>JEI</em>、<em>EMI</em>、<em>ModernFix</em>、<em>Flerovium</em>、<em>FTB Quests</em>、<em>Apotheosis</em>、<em>等</em>模组兼容。<br>🎨 <strong>高度自定义</strong> - 您可以更改、裁剪、扩展和移动<em>任何</em>您想要的内容！在众多选项中<em>自由定制</em>！<br>📊 <strong>评级元素</strong> - 在物品名称下方，会显示<em>稀有度/品质标识</em>（可配置，默认关闭）。<br>⚡ <strong>效果与边框</strong> - 可选择动画<em>边框</em>、覆盖层和自定义样式等内容。<br>🧩 <strong>模组兼容性</strong> - 任何模组都可以添加自己的自定义边框。<br>🌀 <strong>3D 物品渲染</strong> - 悬停在物品上时会显示 3D 图标。<br>🎲 <strong>晕影效果</strong> - 一种新型装饰，允许您为工具提示添加各种形状的内部渐变。<br>❄️ <strong>游戏内配置界面</strong> - 此外，可以打开一个完全自定义的配置界面，在游戏内访问设置。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">📦 <em><strong>默认情况下，部分原版物品包含边框。</strong></em><br>如果您喜欢这个想法，我们可以为最受欢迎的模组创建自定义边框并添加原生支持。🙌</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">本模组高度可配置。如有任何问题、疑问、贡献、关于内容/模组的新想法等，您可以加入我们的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">💬 官方 Discord</a> 并在相应频道留言。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fPxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a255b953-62ec-43d7-b4b3-8a1a94b36bac.png\" alt=\"Discord 横幅\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">所有错误报告或功能请求都应直接联系我，您可以加入我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fPxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>配置 ⚙️</strong></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有两种方式配置工具提示：<em>全局</em>或<em>特定</em>配置。📝</span></span></p><ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;对于<strong>全局配置</strong>，您需要修改文件 </span></span> <code>config/tooltipoverhaul/tooltipoverhaul.toml</code><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，该文件包含适用于所有物品的配置选项。</span></span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;对于<strong>特定配置</strong> <em>（针对特定物品、标签或命名空间/模组ID）</em>，您需要修改位于&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;<code>config/tooltipoverhaul/custom_frames.json</code><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 的文件。有关如何使用此文件的更多信息，请参阅此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wiki</strong></a>。</span></span></li>\n</ul><p>要重新加载<em>特定配置</em>，您可以使用命令 <code>'/tooltipoverhaul reload'</code>，无需重启游戏，而全局设置会自动重新加载！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>资源包 🎨</strong></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也可以创建<strong>资源包</strong>来添加自定义边框或自定义配置。更多信息，请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Custom-Frame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wiki</strong></a>。<br></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>查看</strong>以下<em>材质包</em>，它们添加了<em>更多</em>边框和功能！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jolly-tooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_139f83d7-2461-4ef3-a360-c3eeb241a7cb.gif\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>展示 📷</strong></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多信息，请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Content-and-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>图标动画</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>缩放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_710de09a-00ff-4dbf-a52c-e7fd191a8238.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>旋转</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_96fcdc92-aec7-4e72-8362-0afc6bf10907.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>快速旋转</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_f662105e-aaac-45f1-9fcd-86e07fc98f25.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>旋转缩放</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_8e693f98-e831-4747-a49a-780caaac7e4f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>缩放快照</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0801c7e9-7401-4411-9813-55470e190b0f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>倾斜</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_daf92bbe-e6e4-4615-bd68-9c9e7445f77e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>振动</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da3a6e73-2f1f-4351-8708-1eeac1fb7c2c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>倾斜波浪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e9de8114-60b6-4eea-9490-165cd845469f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>翻转</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7ade282e-49b3-4c28-bdb2-d7a77d610bf3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>钟摆</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e907728e-75aa-4f50-8115-d457a7eeeb19.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>弹跳</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_867a38c4-1f48-4396-a8bf-9504fab84ea3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>下落</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_b39aef12-e088-4801-8971-7962fbef5c99.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>脉冲</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_d41863b1-11a5-4c07-a127-ff15524f20ab.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>淡入</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5c43e9d5-03fc-4497-8c1b-c2c367c32a9c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>悬停弹出</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da470af0-1239-4df2-ad7f-64c6bd63405f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>桶滚</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e8ea3b98-47b1-42a9-bdb0-e26d2c7eb643.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>效果</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>金属光泽</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qFedqV8.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><br>星云<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_745e0555-e12a-43df-abfb-0f4b48e7af3a.gif\" width=\"398\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>回声</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c9a01ea9-6960-479a-8bb2-cce21d559607.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>速度线</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_14d36d67-1da3-4bcd-a606-196a7286913a.gif\" width=\"405\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>白色尘埃</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_85b3c1da-5800-4828-a267-092facdfad7c.gif\" width=\"403\" height=\"227\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>星系</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_55e6c529-e55d-440a-a78b-9996fcc93731.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>螺旋</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0607039c-7936-4500-8753-89dde6b156df.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>光球</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_1d08b434-77a6-4808-b0c8-32f06abe3ee7.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>边缘光</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o0gMIwU.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>涟漪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FwumAw7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>声呐</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRU7jVR.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>星星</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wiTPtpy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>余烬</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N1Yfe7n.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>边框覆盖层</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 琥珀边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_baca4ef8-e32c-4943-9b72-585d14a90757.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 紫水晶边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_9422751d-3e2e-4924-a7b0-8b49d1eb11f2.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 天使边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_6dcb7eeb-a5dd-4ac0-9480-cb60ee7a7ad4.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 战斗边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_07bf3456-f9c7-4345-8faf-9889396b8228.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 灾变边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ebb1c767-10e9-48e2-8567-456b1b84f968.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 恶魔边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ca5a36e8-c693-4b07-a6a6-67c2fa92c023.gif\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 钻石边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ab4b1236-659a-4298-9cae-5ef103383adb.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 绿宝石边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5abf01b7-b648-4d8e-b6bc-cec029a5c625.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 火焰边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_98c0ee0f-c1ea-4620-9b42-c6e56b3c517a.gif\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 花朵边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_6fa506ba-30e1-4be4-ac7a-0b18dce1c40c.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 寒霜边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_82bb29a5-bf61-4186-bcdd-ca90c1d0bd65.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 未来主义边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_154869a1-340b-4deb-b9e8-a00caadf06ec.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 齿轮边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_16478723-c99c-43ff-aef9-68ab9a090a2d.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 枪械与线路边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_6dd81020-a327-41e8-b640-9d6f8ac33b29.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 王者边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_71c9dfbc-f1f0-48d5-a11d-dde888bdb800.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 白银边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_4081bd7d-3705-471c-b5ab-5ebe9c7749e8.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 蒸汽朋克边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_b1791fca-e20c-4183-a611-7a15c8e1a416.gif\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 僵尸大脑边框.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e322c1ae-aa48-40d8-a2e4-8c3ea88e7c32.png\" width=\"264\"><br>- 龙焰边框.png</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_813f2120-06a1-44aa-97d3-05e85879f9d5.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 中世纪十字路口边框.png&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5dfb890e-cf0f-4f6b-8347-746d71621fff.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 等离子灯边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e8e0178f-f2d5-435c-be18-e627cb71359e.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 霓虹火焰边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_43e24e70-d5ae-4949-aa4a-c3e5d38658c4.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 花园边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_3334b176-b44e-44b1-aba3-7f339b50fd71.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 建造朋克边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2a25eb06-6e05-42fc-92fd-08ccd3c6f31e.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 穴居人边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_eb0d181c-18b6-41b6-820a-eba6a274ac56.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 核警报边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e3ccf7cc-938a-49f2-ab90-1033399627a2.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 软糖熊边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2e288886-4f4c-4f88-9e3a-517473b8d07f.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 希腊神庙边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_a37f58df-8ba9-4ce0-b63a-12c938fb34d9.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- 纯粹炼金边框.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ea50cd7b-0819-4fb4-a8f6-057989d94d91.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- 天空之境边框.png<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_25f8541e-a6d9-4a3e-a069-79ebccc0ee17.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>晕影效果</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>圆形</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0cba7784-f252-4ec4-9205-efb9963933a0.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>孔洞</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_58beecac-0e05-43e8-aa29-4e367af662db.gif\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>极致自定义</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>多样风格！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NsOvwXU.gif\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>效果连锁叠加！</p>\n<p><img src=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c16824dd-21a7-4d09-8f3d-9761b1f194d6.gif\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>附加信息 📝</strong></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组完全为客户端模组。</span></span></p><p><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric与Forge版本均无需额外依赖，只需下载本模组，放入mods文件夹即可开始游戏！</span></span></em></p><p><em>在Fabric版本中，如需访问游戏内配置界面，您需要安装&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>！</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>制作团队 📦</strong></h1><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Xylonity - 程序员与模组设计师</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TheModderG - 工具提示覆盖层与模组图标设计师</span></span></p>",
